{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は16人のプリンシパルdeux"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演初日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はしばらく研修旅行で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道に行ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日間長かったですただいま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので今日は出演できませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日公演が終わったあとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまと急いで変更点などの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確認をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感覚を公演の態勢に戻さないと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道からの公演という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハードなスケジュールですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/31/1154931/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/31/1154931/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/31/1154931/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な公演になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼旭山動物園にて／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/31/1154931/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワニ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/31/1154931/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強敵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}